# this single entry is what makes the type exist for the SDK. The map's last
# entry `roadmap,` (unique at this indent, grep -c = 1) KEEPS its trailing
# comma, so a plain INSERT after it is safe — this is not an A3 last-element
# case. Key is quoted because kebab-case types need it ('status-legend' sets
# the precedent). Guard derives from the MARK line.
IN "js/packages/react/src/blocks/core.ts"
### Register the {{.block-name}} emitter in the coreEmitters map
INSERT AFTER FIRST
::: coreEmitters tail anchor :::
