::: {{.block-name}} map entry :::
MARK "js-map-{{.block-name}}"

# Edit 3/4: the CASES fixture. The suite's self-proof test asserts
# CASES ≡ REGISTERED_TYPES (PortableDoc.test.tsx:310-313) — without this
